  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Governors&#x2019; Climate and Forests Task Force (GCF) Secretariat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assist GCF member states and provinces in achieving the objectives of the Rio Branco Declaration and GCF 2020 strategy.The proposal includes three project-specific outcomes:(1) the GCF has promoted subnational political engagement and leadership; (2) the GCF is measuring and reporting its members&#x2019; performance in advancing jurisdictional approaches that protect and restore forests, reduce emissions, and enhance livelihoods; and (3) the GCF has enhanced the its strategic partnerships and networks. The Rio Branco declaration is a political statement by governors in forest rich countries to be on the fronline in the effort to reduce tropical deforestation.</narrative>
  </description>
